  "body": "## Summary\n\n- make workout clicks open a read-only detail view instead of implicitly starting soreness entry\n- add explicit create, edit, and delete paths with required overall intensity and optional muscles\n- separate POST creation from PUT updates so saving cannot overwrite a different record\n- update lane/timeline navigation and offline snapshot schema for record-level intensity\n\n## Validation\n\n- frontend production build\n- targeted ESLint on changed frontend modules (0 errors)\n- backend route syntax check\n- mocked create/update API contract\n- snapshot generation and reader verification\n- repository MSAL, image-fingerprint, newline, YAML-extension, and OpenTofu guards\n\nThe repository-wide frontend lint still reports two pre-existing errors in unmodified `frontend/src/App.jsx`; this change introduces no lint errors in the touched modules.\r\n",
